We need to examine BaseJsonValidator's collectAnnotations implementation. Not provided, but we can infer typical logic: 

```
protected boolean collectAnnotations(ExecutionContext executionContext) {
    if (executionContext == null) {
        return false;
    }
    if (!executionContext.isCollectAnnotationsEnabled()) {
        return false;
    }
    String keyword = getKeyword();
    if (keyword == null) {
        return false;
    }
    return collectAnnotations(executionContext, keyword);
}
```

